    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it’s just hard to see the point of those little things. like, what’s the point of taking care of myself or even making coffee or something when everything that actually mattered is just... gone? it feels so stupid. like i'm just a ghost in this house now. everything feels so hollow and meaningless.",
