    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly it just feels like i'm stuck in this loop. the more i think about it, the more i realize how much of life is just... waiting for things to die or leave. it feels so exhausting to keep trying to build something on top of a pile of loss. like, why even bother dragging myself through another day of just waiting for the next thing to go? it feels like there's no real advantage to staying.",
